1:# item-T244 — Observe + Plan · recreation Cycle 042 Wave 39 · FIRST ATTEMPT (queue #109)
5:Prior attempts: none (first attempt). Family context (five-lens first attempts): T195 88.6 · T03 79.2 · T12 75.4 · T132 83.2. Plateau priced in Plan (A2/jev-plan-exit): family stuck lens class is timing; this Plan prices it by ASR-measured line onsets + named per-word allocation (below).
